  "b6_reason": "Taking P on the dipole axis at 5 cm from center (half-separation 3 cm) gives near/far distances 2 cm and 8 cm: V = Kq(1/2 - 1/8) = 3qK/8.",
  "b6_working": "a=3cm (half of 6cm), r=5cm from center along axis -> r_near=r-a=2, r_far=r+a=8; V=Kq/r_near - Kq/r_far = Kq/2 - Kq/8 = 3Kq/8",
  "b6_confidence": "medium",
